  "titanSays": [
    {
      "day": 7,
      "line": "📻 \"Why do the small humans keep putting organic matter in their FACE-HOLES? We built you a fusion pellet! ...You BURIED it. WHY did you bury the pellet?!\""
    },
    {
      "day": 60,
      "line": "🔭 Scouts come back pale. The sky looks wrong. Not cloudy, not dark — just... bigger. Like it's closer than it should be."
    },
    {
      "day": 61,
      "line": "📯 MUSTER — scouts report The Eater hunting near Haven, and it is beyond us. Everyone inside. No one walks the treeline alone — the garden crews double up, the hunters stand down. We outlast it."
    },
    {
      "day": 64,
      "line": "📻 The old ones point at the horizon and don't speak. The System, for once, is quiet too. Then: the Herald. It heralds the apocalypse the way dawn heralds the day."
    },
    {
      "day": 66,
      "line": "📻 It moves."
    },
    {
      "day": 73,
      "line": "🗺️ Scouts found its lair — tile 7,4. THE HERALD — the sky, getting bigger. It is WAITING. You cannot face it alone. Sound the call."
    },
    {
      "day": 73,
      "line": "🌪️ THE HERALD struck Stonebridge in the night. They bled while the coalition talked. (trust −5 — they notice who wasn't there.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 78,
      "line": "🌪️ THE HERALD struck Stonebridge in the night. They bled while the coalition talked. (trust −5 — they notice who wasn't there.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 79,
      "line": "🗣️ Kate to Ursula, by the fire: \"It eats while we deliberate. The Herald feeds on our stores and we're supposed to just... wait?\""
    },
    {
      "day": 83,
      "line": "🌪️ THE HERALD fed in the night — 0 kcal gone from your stores. It is eating the realm while you deliberate."
    },
    {
      "day": 87,
      "line": "🩸 The Herald mauled Ruth (-11 health) over 3 rounds. They're lucky to be breathing."
    },
    {
      "day": 88,
      "line": "🌪️ THE HERALD fed in the night — 0 kcal gone from your stores. It is eating the realm while you deliberate."
